  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.ibps.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Institute Of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS)</a> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the Reserve Lists for the recruitment of IBPS RRB Bank Officer Scale-I, II, III Post and Office Assistant Mains Admit Card on the official website of the IBPS. &nbsp;Online applying process for IBPS RRB 14th Officer / Clerk Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 01 September 2025 to 28 September 2025. The Officer Scale-I, II, III Interview examination was conducted on January / February 2026. Candidates who had applied for this form can download their IBPS RRB Officer Scale-I, II, III Reserve Lists 2026.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">IBPS RRB XIV Officer Scale-I, II, III Reserve Lists 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Starting Date :<strong> 01 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Registration :<strong> 28 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date :<strong> 28 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Correction Form :<strong> 06-07 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Officer Scale-I Exam Date :<strong> 22 – 23 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Officer Scale-I Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>16 November 2025 Available Now</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">OA PET Exam Date : <strong>November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OA PET Admit Card :<strong> 26 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OA Pre Exam Card : <strong>November, December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OA Pre Admit Card : <strong>06, 07, 13, 14 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Result : <strong>19 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date (Scale-II, III)&nbsp;:<strong>&nbsp;28 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card (Scale-II, III)&nbsp;:<strong>&nbsp;20 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Exam Date (Officer Scale-I) : <strong>28 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Admit Card (Officer Scale-I) : <strong>21 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Assistant Pre Result : <strong>23 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview Date (Officer Scale-I, II, III) :<strong> January / February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview Admit Card (Officer Scale-I, II, III)&nbsp;:<strong> 23 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Exam Date (Office Assistants)&nbsp;<strong>: 01 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Admit Card (Office Assistants)&nbsp;<strong>: 23 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Score Card (Scale I, II, III) : <strong>13 February 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Final Result : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>23 February 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Reserve Lists : <strong>01 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 850/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST : <strong>Rs. 175/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">PH : <strong>Rs. 175/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS RRB 14th Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 September 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For Office Assistant&nbsp;<strong>:&nbsp;18-28 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For Officer Scale-I&nbsp;<strong>:&nbsp;18-30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For Officer Scale-II&nbsp;<strong>:&nbsp;21-32 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For Officer Scale-III<strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;21-40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per IBPS RRB 14th Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS RRB 14th 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 13217+77 = 13294</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Post Name</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">No. of Posts</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post &amp; Category Wise Vacancy Details</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Assistant (Multipurpose)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">7972</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-40.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-I (Assistant Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3907</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-41.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (General Banking Officer)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">854</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-42.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (CA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">69</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-44.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Law)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">48</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-45.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Marketing)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">15</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-47.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Treasury Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">16</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-46.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Agriculture)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">50</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-48.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (IT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">87</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-43.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.5216%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-III (Senior Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7835%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">199</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25-49.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>IBPS RRB 14th Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Office Assistant (Multipurpose)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have completed their Graduation in any discipline from any recognized University/institute will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Proficiency in local language as prescribed by the participating RRB.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable:</strong> Working knowledge of Computer.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-I (Assistant Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have completed their Graduation in any discipline from any recognized University/institute will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Preference will be given to the candidates having degree in Agriculture, Horticulture, Forestry, Animal Husbandry, Veterinary Science, Agricultural Engineering, Pisciculture, Agricultural Marketing and Cooperation, Information Technology, Management, Law, Economics or Accountancy;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Proficiency in local language as prescribed by the participating RRB.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable:</strong> working knowledge of Computer.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (General Banking Officer)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have completed their Graduation in any discipline with minimum 50% marks from any recognized University/institute will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Preference will be given to the candidates having degree in Banking, Finance, Marketing, Agriculture, Horticulture, Forestry, Animal Husbandry, Veterinary Science, Agricultural Engineering, Pisciculture, Agricultural Marketing and Cooperation, Information Technology, Management, Law, Economics and Accountancy.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">2 years experience&nbsp;as an officer in a Bank or Financial Institution.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (CA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have passed CA Exam from ICAI India will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1 year experience as a Chartered Accountant. </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Law)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must having Degree from a recognized&nbsp;University in Law or its equivalent with a minimum of 50% marks in aggregate&nbsp;will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">2 years experience as an advocate or should have worked as Law Officer in Banks or Financial Institutions for a period of not less than two years.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Marketing)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having MBA Degree in marketing from a recognized&nbsp;University will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1 year experience in the relevant field.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Treasury Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having degree in CA or MBA Degree in Finance from a recognized&nbsp;University will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1 year experience in the relevant field.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (Agriculture)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduation Degree in agriculture / Horticulture / dairy / animal / Veterinary Science / Engineering / Pisciculture from Recognized university / Institute with will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">2 Years experience in the relevant field.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-II (IT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"> Candidates must having Graduation Degree in Electronics / Communications / Computer science / Information Technology with Minimum 50% Marks from any recognized University / Institute will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Desirable:</strong> Certificate in ASP, PHP, C++, Java, VB, VC, OCP etc.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1 year experience in the relevant field.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2197%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Officer Scale-III (Senior Manager)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 66.7803%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having&nbsp;Bachelor’s degree in any discipline from a recognized University or its equivalent with a minimum of 50% marks in aggregate. Preference will be given to the candidates having Degree/ Diploma in Banking, Finance, Marketing, Agriculture, Horticulture, Forestry, Animal Husbandry, Veterinary Science, Agricultural Engineering, Pisciculture, Agricultural Marketing and Co-operation, Information Technology, Management, Law, Economics and Accountancy.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum 5 years’ experience as an Officer in a Bank or Financial Institutions.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS RRB 14th Online Form 2025 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Pre Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Mains Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">IBPS RRB XIV Officer Scale-I, II, III Reserve Lists 2026 : How To Download</span>&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></l